  "legacy": {
    "notes": "The folders of the first releases, when the mod was called CyberpunkConvai. The Scripts package carries a do-nothing init.lua at modDirectory; the Runtime package carries a launcher.ini with enabled=0 at pluginDirectory and a native-off.txt that says all at modDirectory/runtime. Extracting over an old installation overwrites the old files, so the old copy cannot start beside the new one. packaging/runtime/migrate-legacy.mjs moves the player's state and deletes these folders at the first start.",
    "modDirectory": "bin/x64/plugins/cyber_engine_tweaks/mods/CyberpunkConvai",
    "pluginDirectory": "red4ext/plugins/CyberpunkConvai"
  },
  "limits": {
    "assetBytes": 1950000000,
    "githubFileBytes": 1950000000,
    "notes": "assetBytes: a Scripts or Runtime zip is closed and continued in another before it passes this (the GitHub release's 2 GiB limit). githubFileBytes: a single file that large in those packages stops the build. The optional packs (OmniVoice, Local AI, Mature) are hosted on Hugging Face as ONE zip each and have no limit here: no parts, no split files."
